# The repository root .gitignore carries a blanket `lib/` rule (a Python
# build-artifact convention from DentalPin). In this project `lib/` is
# application source — Next.js convention — so it is re-included here.
# The directory itself must be un-excluded before files inside it can be:
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
!lib/
!**/lib/
